        "start": 900.0,
        "end": 1920.0
      }
    ],
    "text": "Pay close attention to this derivation: O = floor((W - K + 2P)/S) + 1. Worked example: W=32, K=5, P=2, S=1 -> O = floor((32 - 5 + 4)/1) + 1 = 32. If S=2 and P=0, O = floor((32 - 5)/2) + 1 = 14.",
